SWEET synthetic swipes (patch 0152, boot-arg sweetswipe=N, default off; G-10 touch latency): every N seconds (first at 120 s after the touch service starts) SweetHIDTouch injects a 160 ms swipe (20 steps of 8 ms): up from the bottom edge (y 2350 to 900: the lockscreen unlock needs the home indicator area, a start at y 2000 did not unlock in g68), then left/right/left on the home screen, through the normal touch() path, so lag can be measured without a person. Also records the host time of the latest finger-down (sweet_touch_down_ns) for the latency probe 0153. No hardware access.
